WEBVTT

00:00:35.494 --> 00:00:39.623
As far back as I can remember,
it has been raining.

00:00:41.959 --> 00:00:48.298
Legends tell of vast continents and
great cities before the catastrophe.

00:00:49.466 --> 00:00:52.219
But it's all just
faded glory of the past.

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:59.309
Our ancestors foresaw the catastrophe,
escaped to Sisil Island in the Pacific

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:04.273
and built another Noah's Arc,
a self-growing city

00:01:06.316 --> 00:01:10.862
that feeds of pollution,
called ECOBAN.

00:01:13.657 --> 00:01:17.578
Refugee ships flooded
in by the thousands.

00:01:18.328 --> 00:01:21.498
But ECOBAN didn't allow

00:01:22.541 --> 00:01:27.379
the contaminated
refugees into the city.

00:02:07.961 --> 00:02:10.547
Unit 2, to the opposite side!

00:02:10.714 --> 00:02:12.841
Unit 4, pull harder!

00:02:12.966 --> 00:02:16.553
Crane! What the hell are you doing?

00:02:17.387 --> 00:02:20.349
Pull it back Unit 2, come on!

00:02:21.391 --> 00:02:23.727
Pull it back! I said pull, damn it!

00:02:34.237 --> 00:02:37.324
The workers' safety is at risk down there.
| request you stop work at once.

00:02:37.574 --> 00:02:41.244
Who cares? They're just animals
to be worked, not coddled!

00:03:07.062 --> 00:03:08.146
God damn it.

00:03:08.271 --> 00:03:10.565
They're not even worth
the food they eat!

00:03:32.170 --> 00:03:33.338
This is a waste of time.

00:03:33.505 --> 00:03:36.049
We should burn it all to hell!

00:03:36.675 --> 00:03:39.469
Sir! Please, help us, quick!

00:03:39.636 --> 00:03:41.430
They're all going to be killed!

00:03:41.596 --> 00:03:44.683
You're ruining the equipment!

00:03:44.808 --> 00:03:46.017
Disconnect the deck!

00:03:46.143 --> 00:03:48.937
What? No!

00:03:49.062 --> 00:03:50.981
People are still down there!

00:03:57.279 --> 00:03:59.156
Don't remember asking
for your opinion.

00:03:59.281 --> 00:04:00.741
Flip the switch!

00:04:00.866 --> 00:04:03.952
- Over my dead body!
- Your dead body, eh?

00:04:04.536 --> 00:04:07.998
Jay, give him what he wants.

00:04:08.999 --> 00:04:11.418
- That's not my job, sir.
- What?

00:04:21.052 --> 00:04:22.554
Disconnect, hurry!

00:04:52.626 --> 00:04:56.755
Your first duty is
to obey my orders!

00:04:57.339 --> 00:04:59.216
Return to ECOBAN immediately!

00:08:17.872 --> 00:08:24.796
Director Kim, Moon-e yang

00:08:31.594 --> 00:08:33.638
What is the Adjutant thinking?

00:08:35.390 --> 00:08:38.268
Is he tying to provoke riots?

00:08:38.393 --> 00:08:43.398
Or is he really tying to
slaughter the Marrians?

00:08:44.232 --> 00:08:47.318
He's just doing what
he can to increase...

00:08:47.444 --> 00:08:49.446
pollution for our DELOS system.

00:08:50.822 --> 00:08:54.534
But, it is true his methods
are dangerous.

00:08:54.951 --> 00:08:57.746
I'll ask the Governor
to intercede.

00:08:58.288 --> 00:09:01.166
It won't do any good.

00:09:01.708 --> 00:09:04.294
To them, Marrians are
little more then insects.

00:09:04.794 --> 00:09:07.797
You've gone so soft, Jay!

00:09:08.131 --> 00:09:10.967
We must not forget out city ECOBAN.

00:09:11.593 --> 00:09:15.805
You know that mercy is forbidden...

00:09:16.514 --> 00:09:18.892
so as to preserve our pure ECOBAN.

00:09:19.726 --> 00:09:23.813
Why don't you hang out with your colleague
and have a drink. Forget all that shit!

00:09:24.022 --> 00:09:25.440
Just relax!

00:09:55.470 --> 00:09:57.180
Still brooding over that?

00:09:58.306 --> 00:10:00.266
I'm just tired.

00:10:02.435 --> 00:10:05.730
Then I'll transfer you to domestic patrol.

00:10:05.855 --> 00:10:08.983
Nothing is hard here on the inside.

00:10:09.818 --> 00:10:11.319
I'll see you later.

00:11:29.898 --> 00:11:32.525
- What is it?
- Intruder alert in the Control Center!

00:11:32.650 --> 00:11:35.236
- What?
- The security sensor was triggered.

00:11:35.445 --> 00:11:37.697
Send a patrol to the Center.

00:11:37.822 --> 00:11:38.740
I'm on my way.

00:11:45.955 --> 00:11:48.082
Patrol 1 to the DELOS Center!

00:12:25.912 --> 00:12:26.996
There you are!

00:12:27.121 --> 00:12:29.040
The plate has been hacked, sir.

00:12:29.207 --> 00:12:31.960
- No other plate?
- No, sir.

00:12:32.293 --> 00:12:34.128
He'll run for the side.

00:12:34.254 --> 00:12:36.422
Turn the fans on in Area 3!

00:12:38.675 --> 00:12:40.343
Yes, that's right.

00:12:42.136 --> 00:12:44.681
Alpha to 330, Bravo to 348/

00:12:44.847 --> 00:12:46.182
Charlie to 353/

00:12:46.307 --> 00:12:48.726
Chase the intruder to Exit 3.

00:13:10.498 --> 00:13:11.541
There!

00:13:16.963 --> 00:13:20.675
Target sighted in Zone 3.
Alpha, move to 33/

00:14:38.628 --> 00:14:41.381
We lost his trail, sir.

00:14:41.506 --> 00:14:43.633
Nothing here either, sir.

00:14:58.356 --> 00:15:00.233
Control room, stop fan 31!

00:15:01.734 --> 00:15:03.152
Stop the fan 31/

00:15:03.277 --> 00:15:05.655
Not bad.

00:15:09.909 --> 00:15:12.995
Control, it's Jay.
Show me the Time-Capsule Room.

00:15:46.195 --> 00:15:50.366
What, now this rat's got wings?

00:17:01.812 --> 00:17:03.064
Jay, report your position.

00:17:03.564 --> 00:17:06.484
I'm in the Time-Capsule Room.
| think he's here.

00:17:54.824 --> 00:17:56.826
Jay, acknowledge!

00:18:46.667 --> 00:18:49.378
- Jay, are you okay?
- Yes.

00:18:49.795 --> 00:18:51.380
What happened?

00:18:51.797 --> 00:18:54.550
Sorry, I almost got him.

00:18:54.800 --> 00:18:56.927
How could he have got this far?

00:19:00.056 --> 00:19:03.517
We assumed
our security impenetrable,

00:19:03.684 --> 00:19:05.895
But today the DELOS Center,
of all places, was infiltrated

00:19:05.978 --> 00:19:10.399
and the man responsible
escaped unscathed.

00:19:10.983 --> 00:19:15.196
He knew the DELOS system
like the back of his hand.

00:19:15.446 --> 00:19:19.867
A few more minutes, and he'd
have connected to the mainframe,

00:19:20.409 --> 00:19:22.870
allowing him to cause
a DELOS energy release.

00:19:23.746 --> 00:19:26.832
- ADELOS energy release?
- That's correct.

00:19:26.957 --> 00:19:30.711
Like the breach 10 years ago.

00:19:30.920 --> 00:19:34.173
You mean he's alive?

00:19:34.298 --> 00:19:36.717
Dr. Noah?

00:19:36.926 --> 00:19:39.095
There's no reason to
doubt otherwise.

00:19:39.595 --> 00:19:43.432
The Marrian idiots could
never puzzle out the system,

00:19:43.599 --> 00:19:46.018
even if we gave them
the blueprints.

00:19:46.936 --> 00:19:50.189
Dr. Noah knows of our situation.

00:19:50.314 --> 00:19:53.609
DELOS energy levels
are running so low...

00:19:53.776 --> 00:19:57.905
that ECOBAN has stopped
its groth.

00:19:58.322 --> 00:20:01.492
If we leave him alive,

00:20:01.617 --> 00:20:04.120
he'll just keep
destroying our system.

00:20:04.537 --> 00:20:07.707
We can no longer afford to
postpone on a decision.

00:20:08.457 --> 00:20:13.003
Either we give up DELOS system
as traitor Dr. Noah once insisted,

00:20:13.129 --> 00:20:16.632
and spend rest of our life
with disgusting scumbag like Marrians,

00:20:16.924 --> 00:20:21.929
or keep ECOBAN for prosperity
of pure human beings.

00:20:22.763 --> 00:20:26.267
We decided on
this matter 10 years ago.

00:20:26.392 --> 00:20:30.813
There is no reason to hold back
our plans for Operation Marr any longer.

00:20:31.480 --> 00:20:36.485
Torch the whole field
to catch a few rats?

00:20:36.652 --> 00:20:39.029
One rat made it in,
but he failed.

00:20:39.155 --> 00:20:41.532
Our security is reliable.

00:20:42.158 --> 00:20:44.201
They may be
no more than animals,

00:20:44.326 --> 00:20:46.954
but animals we need for work.

00:20:47.037 --> 00:20:49.999
Too much oppression
will prompt a revolt.

00:20:50.666 --> 00:20:52.376
More pollution for energy!

00:20:52.501 --> 00:20:55.004
That is our ultimate priority.

00:20:56.005 --> 00:20:58.549
Yes, to get more energy,

00:20:58.674 --> 00:21:02.470
we must expand
the polluted area

00:21:02.845 --> 00:21:05.765
but if we kill the Marrians
then who'll do the work?

00:21:05.890 --> 00:21:07.641
And though it's unlikely,

00:21:07.767 --> 00:21:10.269
what if they were to revolt?

00:21:10.644 --> 00:21:15.149
The Marrians outnumber
ECOBAN 10 to 1.

00:21:15.733 --> 00:21:19.862
How can I trust that Security System
that is so soft just like your mind is?

00:21:20.029 --> 00:21:21.864
What may happen,
we never know.

00:21:22.031 --> 00:21:24.825
Our security system
was broken today, wasn't it?

00:21:26.285 --> 00:21:30.915
First, reinforce security
in Marr and ECOBAN.

00:21:31.040 --> 00:21:33.626
Then search for the intruder
and find out his background.

00:21:33.751 --> 00:21:36.378
The matter is important to us.

00:21:46.764 --> 00:21:47.723
Adjutant.

00:21:48.724 --> 00:21:51.393
Prepare for the operation.
Just in case.

00:22:01.529 --> 00:22:05.741
You can't do a simple thing
without stirring up trouble?

00:22:06.408 --> 00:22:10.704
Go do it yourself grandpa,
instead of just telling me what to do.

00:22:11.330 --> 00:22:14.792
| am the one who
should be angry, not you.

00:22:14.917 --> 00:22:16.502
Stupid!

00:22:17.253 --> 00:22:19.630
You know what comes next
after you fail?

00:22:21.632 --> 00:22:23.801
Just give the god damn data
you copied!

00:22:25.261 --> 00:22:27.972
So, let's see...

00:22:28.389 --> 00:22:31.934
what's new in that
ol' mountain of a city?

00:22:42.111 --> 00:22:45.531
The DELOS systems
running low on fuel, I see.

00:22:45.948 --> 00:22:49.326
That's why they are getting hysterical.

00:22:51.245 --> 00:22:54.623
If DELOS system stops,
what happens to ECOBAN?

00:22:54.957 --> 00:22:56.625
We'll see a blue sky.

00:22:57.084 --> 00:23:01.297
Not the sky, I mean ECOBAN.

00:23:02.339 --> 00:23:06.343
They no longer have
enough share themselves.

00:23:06.802 --> 00:23:11.473
They had more than enough so far, at least
they have to know what hunger feels like.

00:23:15.144 --> 00:23:18.981
| once made this system,
so I should end it myself, right?

00:23:20.482 --> 00:23:22.735
Suit yourself.

00:23:23.152 --> 00:23:25.070
Where the hell's Woody?

00:23:25.654 --> 00:23:29.533
Oh yeah, I met her there.

00:23:29.825 --> 00:23:30.993
Who?

00:23:31.994 --> 00:23:34.538
- An old friend.
- What?

00:23:35.664 --> 00:23:39.960
Old friends are for living people.

00:23:40.210 --> 00:23:44.173
You are a dead man. How dare
you mention old friend, whatever?

00:23:44.590 --> 00:23:48.177
Go tell Hot Dog members
to watch out.

00:23:48.302 --> 00:23:52.139
ECOBAN might be up for revenge.

00:23:56.185 --> 00:23:57.978
Let him pass.

00:24:06.946 --> 00:24:08.405
Pass it along!

00:24:11.450 --> 00:24:14.244
Cut the funeral music!

00:24:14.370 --> 00:24:16.038
How about some party tunes!

00:24:25.381 --> 00:24:27.758
Woody, wanna drag?

00:24:27.883 --> 00:24:29.802
It's precious.

00:24:36.433 --> 00:24:38.060
Too hot!

00:24:45.192 --> 00:24:47.736
Hey, what the hell?

00:25:02.418 --> 00:25:04.128
Shual!

00:25:05.254 --> 00:25:07.881
What's the occasion?

00:25:08.090 --> 00:25:11.010
Well, came for Woody, huh?

00:25:11.343 --> 00:25:14.346
Woody went home a while ago, a while...

00:25:19.226 --> 00:25:21.228
Woody, let's go.

00:25:22.646 --> 00:25:24.481
Shual!

00:25:32.406 --> 00:25:34.950
| don't like him,
that ECOBAN outcast!

00:25:35.075 --> 00:25:38.787
If not for Woody,
I'd smash his head in.

00:25:41.290 --> 00:25:45.085
Moe, you seen a wheel
that I left here?

00:25:45.836 --> 00:25:47.963
- This?
- Nah.

00:25:48.505 --> 00:25:50.299
The small one.

00:25:53.552 --> 00:25:56.180
You said you needed this?

00:25:58.724 --> 00:26:02.519
First you hang around with them
and now you steal things?

00:26:03.604 --> 00:26:07.775
| didn't steal it.
| found it.

00:26:07.900 --> 00:26:11.320
You said you needed one
to fix that glider last time.

00:26:16.283 --> 00:26:18.452
Don't hang around with them.

00:26:18.619 --> 00:26:20.829
It's too dangerous, got it?

00:26:23.874 --> 00:26:25.167
| got it.

00:26:31.173 --> 00:26:32.716
Give me the harmonica.

00:26:36.887 --> 00:26:41.225
Shua! That's cool. What is it?

00:26:41.350 --> 00:26:43.227
A bracelet.

00:26:43.352 --> 00:26:45.354
Where did you get it?

00:26:45.562 --> 00:26:49.191
- None of your business, boy.
- Who is it?

00:27:28.230 --> 00:27:30.607
Shua, I forgot where the door is?

00:27:32.234 --> 00:27:34.528
I've told you about Gibraltar, right?

00:27:35.404 --> 00:27:37.781
No, not again.

00:27:38.782 --> 00:27:41.076
Here's the map too.

00:27:42.244 --> 00:27:45.747
Dr. Noah says the sky is blue.

00:27:45.873 --> 00:27:49.084
That people used to
say 'sky blue'.

00:27:49.418 --> 00:27:53.088
And in Gibraltar, the sky and

00:27:53.213 --> 00:27:56.341
ocean are blue. Imagine!

00:28:09.021 --> 00:28:12.191
- Come with me.
- Where?

00:28:28.123 --> 00:28:31.418
It's off limits here.
Let's go back.

00:28:32.211 --> 00:28:33.670
I'm scared.

00:28:33.795 --> 00:28:36.798
Don't worry!

00:28:37.299 --> 00:28:39.843
Just close your eyes
and hold my hand,

00:28:39.968 --> 00:28:42.930
I'll show you something wonderful.

00:28:55.817 --> 00:28:58.153
Go ahead, open your eyes.

00:29:02.407 --> 00:29:05.661
This is wonderful!

00:29:07.496 --> 00:29:09.915
But how'd you know about this?

00:29:10.040 --> 00:29:12.167
Dr. Noah told me!

00:29:12.334 --> 00:29:16.546
He said in Gibraltar,
you can see this every day.

00:29:17.339 --> 00:29:20.550
Jay, promise
we'll go there together.

00:29:36.149 --> 00:29:38.860
It was so beautiful
it blinded your eyes.

00:29:38.986 --> 00:29:41.863
We called it our wonderful Day.

00:29:42.781 --> 00:29:46.660
But it didn't last long.

00:29:47.369 --> 00:29:49.579
That night it disappeared
behind the clouds.

00:29:50.205 --> 00:29:52.666
And I never saw him
after that day.

00:30:05.512 --> 00:30:09.016
We have to be ready for
this operation within 72 hours.

00:30:09.141 --> 00:30:12.561
We gave Marrians enough time
to evacuate so far.

00:30:12.978 --> 00:30:17.691
This operation is important to ECOBAN,
the future of mankind depends on it.

00:30:44.509 --> 00:30:46.720
Hey, it's getting rough!

00:30:46.845 --> 00:30:48.597
There's going to be riot.

00:30:48.764 --> 00:30:52.434
Nuh-uh. Shua would have known,

00:30:52.601 --> 00:30:54.770
but my brother didn't
say anything.

00:30:54.936 --> 00:30:57.773
He's from ECOBAN,

00:30:57.898 --> 00:31:01.151
he can't be your brother?

00:31:01.276 --> 00:31:03.403
He's just some crazy mofo!

00:31:03.570 --> 00:31:05.447
He is too my brother!
Wh-why's he crazy?

00:31:05.572 --> 00:31:08.658
Always rambling on about Gibraltar.

00:31:08.784 --> 00:31:09.785
No such thing in the world.

00:31:10.410 --> 00:31:13.455
You have to live here.

00:31:13.580 --> 00:31:16.083
And I'll teach you
to be a fighter.

00:31:16.416 --> 00:31:19.461
What if I made you as my side-kick.

00:31:22.547 --> 00:31:24.549
Woody! Where you...?

00:31:29.221 --> 00:31:31.139
- Woody!
- Hurry up!

00:31:38.730 --> 00:31:41.400
Now they're rioting
in the morning.

00:31:41.525 --> 00:31:44.069
Guess that means
no business today.

00:31:44.194 --> 00:31:46.029
Did you see Woody by any chance?

00:31:46.405 --> 00:31:50.617
Woody? Yeah I thought
| saw him with that dwarf.

00:31:50.784 --> 00:31:53.120
What is his name?

00:31:53.912 --> 00:31:56.540
Bring me that will you?

00:31:59.501 --> 00:32:02.921
A muscles job is definitely
for younger ones.

00:32:33.201 --> 00:32:36.830
Woody, you crazy?

00:32:37.372 --> 00:32:39.249
What the hell are you doing?

00:32:39.374 --> 00:32:40.959
- Are you crazy?
- W-Wait a sec.

00:32:42.502 --> 00:32:44.629
What in the world...

00:32:46.715 --> 00:32:49.176
He's crazy.
He's asking for it.

00:32:55.724 --> 00:32:58.018
There it comes!
Hit it at the crossroads!

00:33:05.734 --> 00:33:07.235
What the hell is that?
That's an ECOBAN bike.

00:33:23.585 --> 00:33:27.964
If you see Woody,
tell him to go home.

00:33:35.347 --> 00:33:39.935
Jay, there're riots in the plaza.
Let's turn back.

00:33:41.311 --> 00:33:43.230
Fuck you!

00:34:01.623 --> 00:34:03.416
Jay! Are you okay?

00:34:03.833 --> 00:34:05.794
Answer me/

00:37:45.305 --> 00:37:46.639
Shua?

00:37:47.515 --> 00:37:49.476
You're Shua, aren't you?

00:37:52.353 --> 00:37:55.315
Contact with Marrians is
prohibited, isn't it?

00:37:56.900 --> 00:37:59.694
| thought you were dead.

00:38:04.240 --> 00:38:05.658
Go back, Jay.

00:38:07.327 --> 00:38:08.953
Don't ever come here.

00:38:18.087 --> 00:38:19.714
Damn it!

00:38:22.842 --> 00:38:24.385
Those pains in the ass!

00:38:25.178 --> 00:38:26.054
Hide in there.

00:38:28.723 --> 00:38:32.560
Stairs should be wide
and convenient!

00:38:32.685 --> 00:38:35.230
This is slope climbing!

00:38:35.396 --> 00:38:38.983
Oh hey, Shua! There you are.

00:38:41.402 --> 00:38:43.279
The boss wants you.

00:38:44.072 --> 00:38:47.742
Let's plan out our strategy
for the big mission.

00:38:50.620 --> 00:38:54.415
This job's hot!
We're gonna hit ECOBAN's post.

00:38:59.754 --> 00:39:02.715
Hey! This is not right way
of treating a guest.

00:39:02.924 --> 00:39:06.803
Aren't you supposed to offer us
at least something to drink?

00:39:06.928 --> 00:39:10.932
- Where?
- What you mean where? The regular place.

00:39:11.099 --> 00:39:12.475
Woody's there too.

00:39:13.101 --> 00:39:15.645
Yo, man! Aren't you gonna invite us in?

00:39:15.770 --> 00:39:17.981
Are you hiding any girl in the room?

00:39:34.330 --> 00:39:38.793
Go back, Jay.
Don't come back.

00:41:51.509 --> 00:41:54.095
Kill me now, Helen.

00:41:54.429 --> 00:41:56.931
I'm about to explode.

00:41:57.098 --> 00:42:00.685
Get real!
She's twice your size!

00:42:00.810 --> 00:42:03.563
- Don't make me kick your ass!
- What the...?

00:42:04.105 --> 00:42:06.482
Shut the hell up and listen!

00:42:06.816 --> 00:42:11.696
The ECOBANS are bringing in
shipments by trucks every day.

00:42:11.821 --> 00:42:14.115
They're some presents
meant for us, I'm sure.

00:42:14.282 --> 00:42:16.909
| just want Helen, that's all.

00:42:17.910 --> 00:42:21.414
We should accept these gifts.

00:42:21.706 --> 00:42:25.168
- And show them our gratitude.
- What're you talking about?

00:42:25.668 --> 00:42:29.380
Tomorrow, we'll
hit the Ecoban post,

00:42:29.672 --> 00:42:32.091
take our presents.

00:42:32.216 --> 00:42:35.678
<i>- And give them our thanks.
- So?</i>

00:42:37.305 --> 00:42:40.391
What kind of friends
would we be not

00:42:40.516 --> 00:42:42.977
to invite you along
for something as big as this?

00:42:43.227 --> 00:42:44.896
Friends?

00:42:45.897 --> 00:42:49.275
Friends of resistance!

00:42:49.901 --> 00:42:52.779
You're using resistance to justify

00:42:53.237 --> 00:42:55.656
what's little more then theft?

00:42:55.865 --> 00:42:59.285
Keep low if you know
what's good for you.

00:43:00.244 --> 00:43:02.246
Son of a bitch!

00:43:05.750 --> 00:43:08.002
If you could stop thinking
with your muscles

00:43:08.461 --> 00:43:10.671
you'd know what really needs doing.

00:43:11.172 --> 00:43:14.008
Acting stupid and getting yourself
killed is your business.

00:43:14.175 --> 00:43:16.052
But don't drag Woody into it!

00:43:16.177 --> 00:43:19.639
If anything happens to him,
I'll be sending you home in pieces!

00:43:25.019 --> 00:43:29.440
Hey! Who saved Woody today?
You ungrateful little twat!

00:43:29.816 --> 00:43:33.820
As if he is some kind of hero...
But, he doesn't know the reality at all.

00:43:33.945 --> 00:43:36.030
C'mon, hit the music!

00:43:43.579 --> 00:43:46.916
You want to live with them?

00:43:47.500 --> 00:43:50.878
Why? Are you m-mad at me?

00:43:51.629 --> 00:43:54.215
<i>Yes. You ignored my warnings.</i>

00:43:55.174 --> 00:43:57.552
So you're leaving me behind?

00:43:58.553 --> 00:44:00.012
I'll follow you.

00:44:00.054 --> 00:44:01.681
Who's going where?

00:44:02.223 --> 00:44:06.936
| know you'll fix the glider
and leave me behind.

00:44:07.728 --> 00:44:10.648
Then I'll kill myself!

00:44:13.484 --> 00:44:14.652
Stop it!

00:44:16.571 --> 00:44:18.614
What kind of shit are they
cramming into that head of yours.

00:44:18.906 --> 00:44:21.492
And don't joke about dying.

00:44:21.742 --> 00:44:22.952
Here.

00:44:24.287 --> 00:44:27.456
Take it.
| don't need it.

00:44:27.790 --> 00:44:30.751
| know you need this for the glider.

00:44:31.419 --> 00:44:33.754
It's alright.
I'm going no where.

00:44:33.880 --> 00:44:36.757
Really? You're staying with me?

00:44:36.924 --> 00:44:38.718
You keep it anyway.

00:44:39.093 --> 00:44:41.804
Shua, don't leave me
behind no matter what.

00:44:41.929 --> 00:44:43.389
I'll think about it.

00:44:49.729 --> 00:44:52.190
You're sure Jay did that?

00:44:52.315 --> 00:44:55.276
Yes, sir. Positive.

00:44:55.443 --> 00:44:57.778
All right, that's be all.

00:45:00.698 --> 00:45:04.285
Let's keep this between us
for now, Etha.

00:45:05.453 --> 00:45:06.871
Yes, sir.

00:47:01.736 --> 00:47:05.281
Our target is the suspect
who infiltrated the DELOS system.

00:47:05.740 --> 00:47:09.243
He's hiding in a wrecked tanker
in Bay area no. 5.

00:47:10.119 --> 00:47:13.497
<i>If he resists...
then shoot to Kill.</i>

00:48:18.562 --> 00:48:20.940
Alpha 1, no one here!

00:48:21.065 --> 00:48:22.983
Alpha 2, not a thing!

00:48:52.847 --> 00:48:54.807
That bastard is still alive.

00:49:00.354 --> 00:49:02.314
Why didn't you tell me?

00:49:14.076 --> 00:49:15.953
Don't even think about it!

00:49:16.579 --> 00:49:21.000
He should be terminated
for the future of ECOBAN.

00:49:27.756 --> 00:49:29.467
Shit, What the hell is that?

00:49:29.675 --> 00:49:33.888
We don't know when it is coming.
| am sick and tired of waiting.

00:49:34.221 --> 00:49:39.518
Hey! If you do something important,
you must learn to be patient.

00:49:40.644 --> 00:49:42.813
There! That's it.

00:49:44.064 --> 00:49:45.399
Where?

00:49:47.985 --> 00:49:50.696
Ah, I see it!

00:49:51.197 --> 00:49:53.157
Well, how the hell are
we gonna take it!

00:50:02.958 --> 00:50:06.128
Afternoon officer.
Sorry I'm late.

00:50:06.253 --> 00:50:08.214
Who the hell are you?

00:50:08.339 --> 00:50:09.965
Show me your pass.

00:50:10.633 --> 00:50:14.428
Oh, the pass?
| must've dropped it.

00:50:14.762 --> 00:50:18.224
No pass?

00:50:18.390 --> 00:50:19.934
Out of the truck.

00:50:21.602 --> 00:50:26.106
Oh, yes, that is...
Where'd I put it?

00:50:29.527 --> 00:50:32.530
What are you doing?
Get out!

00:50:32.655 --> 00:50:35.658
Right! The pass.

00:50:39.370 --> 00:50:41.288
I'm out!
Whatcha gonna do about it?

00:50:55.177 --> 00:50:56.428
Son of a bitch!

00:51:00.808 --> 00:51:02.268
Move, all of you!

00:51:24.415 --> 00:51:25.624
Hurry!

00:51:30.170 --> 00:51:32.131
Wait! Stop your pursuit!

00:51:36.885 --> 00:51:38.929
Let's party!

00:51:52.860 --> 00:51:54.903
I'm told there was a robbery.

00:51:55.863 --> 00:51:57.865
And what were you doing?

00:51:57.990 --> 00:52:01.702
While these vermin
broke in and stole things?

00:52:02.369 --> 00:52:05.873
How could I protect
something that.

00:52:06.040 --> 00:52:07.374
| had no knowledge
even existed?

00:52:07.791 --> 00:52:10.586
You are full of excuses
and no results.

00:52:10.711 --> 00:52:13.380
If I trusted you,
| wouldn't be here.

00:52:13.839 --> 00:52:17.217
The target changed course
towards Bay Area 2.

00:52:17.426 --> 00:52:20.054
As soon as their final destination
is identified,

00:52:20.179 --> 00:52:22.723
Kill everyone who's around.

00:52:27.853 --> 00:52:32.107
What's with the ruckus? I thought
| told those Hot Dogs to keep quiet.

00:52:32.816 --> 00:52:35.235
Perhaps they scored big today.

00:52:36.195 --> 00:52:39.073
By the way, your glider is OK?

00:52:39.406 --> 00:52:42.576
For what?
No place to go, you said.

00:52:42.743 --> 00:52:46.914
Yes, there is.
| can fly away right now.

00:52:47.039 --> 00:52:49.750
| don't know where would that be.
But, better hurry up...

00:52:50.417 --> 00:52:55.547
ECOBAN is up to something.
They keep trucking something into Marr.

00:52:55.756 --> 00:52:58.008
They're probably tying to
torch all of Marr.

00:52:58.092 --> 00:53:00.219
The DELOS system needs resources,

00:53:00.386 --> 00:53:04.098
so they'll burn and
pollute the whole area.

00:53:04.848 --> 00:53:07.601
Your glider is really OK, right?

00:53:08.602 --> 00:53:10.896
What the hell are you thinking?

00:53:11.563 --> 00:53:13.399
There is only one way now.

00:53:13.524 --> 00:53:15.567
There is no time.
It could be the last chance.

00:53:16.026 --> 00:53:19.863
| am not going to ECOBAN.
Why should I7?

00:53:20.406 --> 00:53:22.825
| am not gonna act like a hero.

00:53:22.950 --> 00:53:24.785
Forget it then.

00:53:34.628 --> 00:53:38.757
Now I am smelling meat
from my stomach.

00:53:39.383 --> 00:53:42.136
By the way, we're totally broke.
What meat are you referring to?

00:53:42.845 --> 00:53:46.473
If you don't have cash, slice your
body meat. Your credit is no good here.

00:53:47.891 --> 00:53:53.939
Even if we were broke for a short while,
you treat us this bad?

00:53:54.481 --> 00:53:58.819
With your attitude like that,
this store will run out of business soon.

00:53:59.570 --> 00:54:02.364
- Right, boss?
- Hey!

00:54:02.489 --> 00:54:06.660
Yo! What the hell happen to Chul-Han?
Speak up, now!

00:54:15.669 --> 00:54:18.172
There're more where it came from.

00:54:18.297 --> 00:54:21.633
So you got something this time.

00:54:21.759 --> 00:54:23.093
Wow, what is it?

00:54:23.218 --> 00:54:27.514
Didn't you just tell we were so broke?
And slice my body?

00:54:27.681 --> 00:54:30.517
Hey you, Shut up and open the box.

00:54:35.230 --> 00:54:36.732
What the hell is it?

00:54:39.902 --> 00:54:41.528
What's this blinking?

00:54:41.987 --> 00:54:43.030
You idiots!

00:54:52.080 --> 00:54:54.208
- Freeze!
- Throw down your weapons!

00:54:54.374 --> 00:54:56.752
- On the floor!
- Hands on the back!

00:55:35.958 --> 00:55:37.125
Move!

00:55:42.673 --> 00:55:43.966
Get away!

00:55:49.096 --> 00:55:50.889
Don't make a sound!

00:55:51.139 --> 00:55:54.601
No matter what, don't come out!

00:56:23.589 --> 00:56:26.925
Perfect time to run out of ammo!

00:56:27.092 --> 00:56:30.804
I'll cross first.
Watch and learn!

00:56:30.971 --> 00:56:32.890
Check this out!

00:56:33.015 --> 00:56:33.891
Moe!

00:56:37.936 --> 00:56:41.148
- Moe!
- Easier said than done!

00:56:41.273 --> 00:56:43.567
Sons of bitches!
Moe, I'm coming!

00:57:01.835 --> 00:57:05.047
Zed!

00:57:05.172 --> 00:57:07.257
Zed!

00:57:15.182 --> 00:57:18.268
W-Woody, it's freezing.

00:57:21.772 --> 00:57:23.690
I'll go and get Shua.

00:57:23.815 --> 00:57:27.027
Don't leave me.
I'm scared.

00:57:27.194 --> 00:57:29.237
Don't be scared.

00:57:29.363 --> 00:57:33.492
- I'm cold.
- I'll be back soon.

00:57:33.617 --> 00:57:36.244
Don't leave me.

00:57:36.370 --> 00:57:39.164
Don't worry. I'll come back.

00:57:39.289 --> 00:57:41.541
And don't sing, okay?

00:58:02.229 --> 00:58:03.939
Hush!

00:58:05.607 --> 00:58:07.567
Hands on the wall!

00:58:07.693 --> 00:58:09.194
One step back!

00:58:09.319 --> 00:58:12.197
Take them out,
and comb the building!

00:58:12.322 --> 00:58:14.032
Yes, sir.

00:58:58.493 --> 00:59:00.162
Where's Karen?

00:59:21.141 --> 00:59:23.727
- Woody?
- Oh my...

00:59:25.479 --> 00:59:26.813
Let's go out.

00:59:28.523 --> 00:59:31.485
| can't.

00:59:32.903 --> 00:59:35.947
Woody told me to wait.

01:01:19.134 --> 01:01:21.094
Why won't you die

01:01:22.429 --> 01:01:24.598
you little cockroach!

01:01:25.265 --> 01:01:27.767
Get up!
I'll finish you off this time!

01:01:28.018 --> 01:01:31.730
Nothing has changed.
Still a hero of ECOBAN.

01:01:31.855 --> 01:01:36.735
You should have died then
for the sake of ECOBAN!

01:01:36.985 --> 01:01:40.197
You mean, it is actually for Jay.

01:01:40.906 --> 01:01:43.450
That's right! Good for you.

01:01:43.575 --> 01:01:46.953
Now you'll have to die again
for Jay's sake, and mine!

01:01:57.464 --> 01:01:59.090
Shua...

01:02:07.057 --> 01:02:09.100
Woody!

01:02:12.187 --> 01:02:13.563
Woody!

01:02:22.822 --> 01:02:25.742
Move! Get out of the way!

01:03:39.941 --> 01:03:45.363
| thought it was me
looking after him,

01:03:46.656 --> 01:03:51.453
but it was the other way around.

01:03:56.124 --> 01:03:58.793
| wanted to show
him the blue sky.

01:04:05.592 --> 01:04:07.719
I'm Sorry, Zed.

01:04:08.428 --> 01:04:11.473
We should have died together.

01:04:12.474 --> 01:04:17.228
I'll revenge no matter what.

01:04:20.899 --> 01:04:23.777
I'm going to ECOBAN.

01:04:23.985 --> 01:04:26.446
You don't have to come
if you don't want to.

01:04:31.117 --> 01:04:33.828
Thank you everyone.

01:04:35.288 --> 01:04:38.541
First, we need Noah's help.

01:04:40.710 --> 01:04:43.922
The Hot Dogs are now crushed,

01:04:44.047 --> 01:04:48.843
but, Dr. Noah and
his agent remain at large.

01:04:48.968 --> 01:04:54.224
They're conspiring to bring
about ECOBAN's downfall.

01:04:54.516 --> 01:04:59.312
Let's not blame security
and waste any more time.

01:05:00.480 --> 01:05:03.733
Operation Marr is ready.

01:05:03.858 --> 01:05:07.529
With your approval,
it can proceed immediately.

01:05:08.738 --> 01:05:11.324
Expediency would be prudent.

01:05:11.574 --> 01:05:13.701
We can no longer
coexist with the Marrians.

01:05:15.328 --> 01:05:17.205
And if energy levels
fall any further,

01:05:17.330 --> 01:05:19.999
many ECOBAN systems
will malfunction.

01:05:20.125 --> 01:05:24.003
Making it much harder to
suppress the Marrian riots.

01:05:24.170 --> 01:05:28.675
Moreover, Dr. Noah and his agent are
probably already preparing something.

01:05:28.800 --> 01:05:32.220
We must eliminate
the root of the problem.

01:05:46.734 --> 01:05:49.737
It's our duty to protect ECOBAN.

01:05:52.031 --> 01:05:54.826
Giving up everything just
because of that son of a bitch.

01:05:54.951 --> 01:05:59.873
Give up on ECOBAN, colleagues,
me, and future?

01:06:01.458 --> 01:06:04.294
What do you mean by
hope and future?

01:06:06.129 --> 01:06:09.466
| don't care anymore.

01:06:09.966 --> 01:06:12.635
By tomorrow all of Marr
will be gone,

01:06:12.760 --> 01:06:15.805
including Shua.

01:06:18.391 --> 01:06:21.728
Is that all you can do
to protect yourself?

01:06:23.480 --> 01:06:25.064
Where are you going?

01:06:25.815 --> 01:06:27.150
Hold it!

01:06:27.358 --> 01:06:28.735
Stop!

01:06:29.944 --> 01:06:32.989
If ECOBAN runs on Marrians' blood,

01:06:33.490 --> 01:06:35.783
I'll be the part of that blood also.

01:09:46.349 --> 01:09:49.769
/I'm sick of
this bleak desolate future.

01:09:50.603 --> 01:09:53.940
I just want a sky
filled with light.

01:09:55.566 --> 01:09:59.320
Like that day so long ago.

01:10:01.197 --> 01:10:03.449
Which is why I have to go.

01:10:04.117 --> 01:10:07.370
[ Don't know where /'ll be.

01:10:08.454 --> 01:10:11.874
But know you're with
me in my heart.

01:10:14.419 --> 01:10:15.795
I love you.

01:11:03.217 --> 01:11:06.012
All troops are assembled!

01:11:06.345 --> 01:11:08.848
All troops are to enforce
internal security.

01:11:09.015 --> 01:11:12.393
Man your posts, stay alert, and report
any suspicious activity immediately!

01:11:12.518 --> 01:11:15.938
Who diverted the troops
from Operation Marr?

01:11:17.690 --> 01:11:19.150
Commander Cade, sir.

01:11:19.275 --> 01:11:21.861
| was ordered to reinforce security.

01:11:22.028 --> 01:11:23.571
Where is he?

01:11:23.696 --> 01:11:26.032
He went to the DELOS Tower, sir.

01:11:26.991 --> 01:11:27.950
What?

01:11:28.075 --> 01:11:31.496
Send the troops to Marr.
That's an order!

01:11:31.704 --> 01:11:33.080
Yes, sir.

01:11:33.206 --> 01:11:35.208
Battalion, on the truck!

01:11:51.766 --> 01:11:56.395
This war won't end until
we shut down the DELOS system.

01:11:57.063 --> 01:12:02.360
You must disconnect the power supply
before Shua puts the spics in the system.

01:12:30.763 --> 01:12:32.390
There! See it?

01:12:35.476 --> 01:12:36.727
Ready!

01:12:37.228 --> 01:12:38.521
Fire!

01:13:00.751 --> 01:13:03.296
The situation is getting critical, sir.

01:13:03.754 --> 01:13:05.423
What you mean?

01:13:05.590 --> 01:13:10.428
<i>Commander Cade's missing after he retrieve
troops from the oil field without an order.</i>

01:13:11.554 --> 01:13:15.141
If something happens to DELOS system,
that'll be the end of it.

01:13:15.391 --> 01:13:17.018
Have the situation in hand quickly.

01:15:26.397 --> 01:15:28.274
That way!

01:15:30.943 --> 01:15:32.987
Hey, hey, aren't
we going too fast?

01:15:33.112 --> 01:15:35.614
All the sooner that
we get to pay them back!

01:15:55.134 --> 01:15:57.970
What's the? What happened?

01:15:58.220 --> 01:16:00.514
There's a gap! Shit!

01:16:00.639 --> 01:16:02.850
That old man...

01:16:02.975 --> 01:16:04.393
Hey! Stop!

01:16:04.518 --> 01:16:06.812
He said go full speed!

01:16:58.072 --> 01:17:02.576
Damn! I must be invincible
to have survived that!

01:17:02.701 --> 01:17:06.914
| must have a guardian angel
and the devil's own luck!

01:17:07.039 --> 01:17:09.708
Shua! Have you waited long?

01:17:47.079 --> 01:17:48.122
Hurry!

01:21:26.590 --> 01:21:30.803
So you finally made it.

01:21:37.559 --> 01:21:40.396
You deserve what you'll get.

01:21:41.021 --> 01:21:44.900
This is what ECOBAN started itself.

01:21:45.025 --> 01:21:46.402
ECOBAN?

01:21:46.610 --> 01:21:49.655
You're ruining everyone's future!

01:21:49.822 --> 01:21:52.991
You're ruining
my future with Jay!

01:21:53.742 --> 01:21:57.496
Why you?
Why should only you have her?

01:22:13.262 --> 01:22:14.513
No!

01:22:17.975 --> 01:22:19.726
Jay, no!

01:22:22.855 --> 01:22:26.733
Don't make me do this to you.

01:22:30.988 --> 01:22:32.281
Jay!

01:29:01.920 --> 01:29:05.632
Grandpa, weird feeling with eyes!

01:29:06.925 --> 01:29:09.594
That's right. That's right.
